<title>GERMANY: ALITALIA APPOINTS NEW CARGO MANAGER GERMANY.</title>
<headline>ALITALIA APPOINTS NEW CARGO MANAGER GERMANY.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alitalia said it has appointed Michele Di Feo as cargo manager Germany.</p>
<p>Di Feo, who replaced temporary manager Biagio Savarino, was previously the airline's Swiss cargo manager for nine years, a company statement said. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax: 5017 - www.racs.com</p>
